IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. GRADE-ANALYZER.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION. 
  01 USER-NAME     PIC X(20).
  01 SCORE-TABLE.
    05 TEST-SCORE  PIC 999 OCCURS 4 TIMES.
  01 DROP-SCORE    PIC A.

  01 AVERAGE       PIC ZZ9V9.
  01 DISP-AVG      PIC ZZ9.9.
  01 GRADE         PIC AA.

  01 IDX           PIC 9 VALUE 1.
  01 MAX-SCORES    CONSTANT 4.
  01 INPUT-BUFFER  PIC XXX VALUE SPACES.
  01 NUM-BUFFER    PIC S999.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
BEGIN. 
  DISPLAY "ENTER YOUR NAME: " WITH NO ADVANCING
  ACCEPT USER-NAME.

  PERFORM VARYING IDX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL IDX > MAX-SCORES
    DISPLAY "ENTER SCORE #" IDX ": " WITH NO ADVANCING
    ACCEPT INPUT-BUFFER

    PERFORM VALIDATE-INPUT

    MOVE NUM-BUFFER TO TEST-SCORE(IDX)
  END-PERFORM.

  PERFORM VARYING IDX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL IDX > MAX-SCORES
    DISPLAY "TEST SCORE #" IDX ": " TEST-SCORE(IDX)
  END-PERFORM.
STOP RUN. 

VALIDATION SECTION.
  VALIDATE-INPUT.
    IF FUNCTION TEST-NUMVAL(INPUT-BUFFER) > 0
      PERFORM INPUT-ERROR
    ELSE
      MOVE FUNCTION NUMVAL(INPUT-BUFFER) TO NUM-BUFFER
      PERFORM VALIDATE-VALUE
    END-IF.

  VALIDATE-VALUE.
    IF NUM-BUFFER < 1
      PERFORM VALUE-ERROR
    END-IF.

RAISE-ERROR SECTION.
  INPUT-ERROR.
    DISPLAY "ERROR: TEST SCORE MUST BE A NUMBER."
    DISPLAY "ENTERED: " QUOTES INPUT-BUFFER QUOTES
    STOP RUN.

  VALUE-ERROR.
    DISPLAY "ERROR: TEST SCORE MUST BE POSITIVE."
    DISPLAY "VALUE RECEIVED: " NUM-BUFFER
    STOP RUN.
